  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - On 28/01/2026, the continuous use of '22 Travellers Way, Hounslow, TW4 7QA' as two self-contained flats was lawful within the meaning of Section 191(2) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\nThe evidence supplied is sufficient to establish that on the balance of probabilities the main house at '22 Travellers Way, Hounslow, TW4 7QA' has been used as a two separate self-contained flats, at ground floor (no.22A) and first and second floors (no.22) respectively, for an uninterrupted period of at least four years from the date of application, and would therefore be lawful under Section 171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended)."
